{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "bfacb20d-9938-8542-8032-e2f23b9ae42c",
  "created_at": "2026-01-08T09:11:43-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Marisol Cordero",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T09:09:42-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works, this is Lorraine. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T09:09:46-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, yeah, um, I'm calling about trash? Like, somebody keeps dumping bags at the corner by my house and I'm totally over it."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T09:09:54-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm sorry about that. Can I get the location where the bags are being left?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T09:10:00-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 141 Callender Avenue? In the North End. The bags are right on the corner next to it, like on the curb."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T09:10:08-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "141 Callender Avenue, North End, on the corner. Got it. And do you know who is leaving them?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T09:10:15-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I'm pretty sure it's a neighbor? I've seen them walk over with bags like, the night before pickup, and just drop them. Not even their own street. [pause] And it's not even pickup day half the time."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T09:10:27-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, so a neighbor is bringing bags to the corner, and it's not always collection day. Are the bags open at all?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T09:10:35-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, ugh, that's the thing. One got ripped open and the kids are home this week, so they're out front and, like, a bag of cereal from it is getting dragged around the yard? By I don't know, a raccoon or a dog. It's everywhere."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T09:10:50-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, that's not good. Cereal, and the bags torn open at the corner. I'll write all that down."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T09:10:56-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Thanks. Honestly I just want somebody to deal with it? Can a supervisor call me back? Because I feel like I've said this and nothing happens."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T09:11:05-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can ask a supervisor to call you. What's the best number?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T09:11:10-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "It's 401-555-0162."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T09:11:12-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Four-oh-one, five-five-five, oh-one-six-two. Is that a cell?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T09:11:15-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, cell. Sorry, I'm on speaker, the kids are being loud. [crosstalk] Guys, hold on. Sorry."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T09:11:21-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries at all. So I have a supervisor calling Marisol Cordero at that number about repeated dumping of trash bags at the corner by 141 Callender Avenue. Did I get the name right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T09:11:32-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yep, Cordero. C-O-R-D-E-R-O."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T09:11:34-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Perfect. I'll send this along today. They'll reach out when they can."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T09:11:39-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, cool. Thanks. Bye."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-01-08T09:11:41-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You're welcome. Bye now."
    }
  ],
